                        <span>USD plan amount: 1 Month ≈ $<%= Number(plan1Usd).toFixed(2) %> • 3 Months ≈ $<%= Number(plan3Usd).toFixed(2) %> • 1 Year ≈ $<%= Number(plan12Usd).toFixed(2) %><br>Submit Order ID + payment screenshot</span>
