<div class="glass-card site-maintenance-admin-card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
                <div class="maintenance-admin-head"><div><div class="dashboard-kicker">GLOBAL CONTROL</div><h2>🛠 Website Maintenance Mode</h2><p>When ON, the public website, user pages, API and every short-link redirect are paused. Admin Panel and /health stay available. Nothing is deleted.</p></div><span class="maintenance-status-pill <%= siteMaintenanceOn?'on':'off' %>"><%= siteMaintenanceOn?'MAINTENANCE ON':'WEBSITE LIVE' %></span></div>
                <form method="POST" action="/admin/site-maintenance/settings" class="maintenance-details-form" id="maintenanceSettingsForm">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Maintenance Message (optional)</label>
